{"_id":"6aba29b87e1f313bfe6dba09","id":"SuperAGI/llm-vs-prediction-markets","author":"SuperAGI","sha":"da455cd2b82cc0f43b03e72a181076d072dc58a1","lastModified":"2026-10-01T08:45:38.000Z","private":false,"gated":false,"disabled":false,"tags":["license:cc-by-4.0","license:cc-by-nc-sa-4.0","arxiv:2604.14199","region:us","forecasting","prediction-markets","llm-evaluation"],"description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tPrice-blind LLM forecasts against prediction markets: main dataset\n\t\n\nThis is the data behind the paper Sorting, Not Calibration: A Price-Blind Comparison of Language Models and Prediction Markets (arXiv link forthcoming; code and paper PDF at https://github.com/TransformerOptimus/llm-vs-prediction-markets). Eight language models were asked for\nthe probability that a prediction-market question resolves Yes, without being\nshown the market price. Their forecasts are compared with the… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/SuperAGI/llm-vs-prediction-markets.","downloads":289,"likes":0,"cardData":{"license":["cc-by-4.0","cc-by-nc-sa-4.0"],"pretty_name":"Price-blind LLM forecasts against prediction markets (main dataset)","tags":["forecasting","prediction-markets","llm-evaluation"]},"siblings":[{"rfilename":".gitattributes"},{"rfilename":"LICENSE"},{"rfilename":"MANIFEST.sha256"},{"rfilename":"README.md"},{"rfilename":"analysis_out/calibration_gate.json"},{"rfilename":"analysis_out/calibration_gate.md"},{"rfilename":"analysis_out/calibration_moment_keys.txt"},{"rfilename":"analysis_out/depth_cuts.json"},{"rfilename":"analysis_out/gate_used.json"},{"rfilename":"analysis_out/quarantine_deepseek-v3.2_probe_A.jsonl"},{"rfilename":"analysis_out/quarantine_deepseek-v3.2_probe_A_summary.json"},{"rfilename":"analysis_out/quarantine_deepseek-v3.2_probe_B.jsonl"},{"rfilename":"analysis_out/quarantine_deepseek-v3.2_probe_B_summary.json"},{"rfilename":"analysis_out/quarantine_deepseek-v4-pro_probe_B.jsonl"},{"rfilename":"analysis_out/